## Title: GaarChatForever
## Notes: Chat tweaks for WoW Forever, each one switchable: short channel names, class-coloured names, timestamps, clickable and copyable links, a copy-chat button, a whisper sound, sticky chat types, arrow keys in the edit box, an automatic party/raid chat channel and a scrolling feed of whispers, group chat and mentions. /gchat
